      "type": "narrative-update",
      "date": "2026-04-22T09:06:42.000Z",
      "title": "IOC: Lower Margin Outlook And Rising P/E Will Likely Restrain Future Returns",
      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their price target on Indian Oil to ₹104.61 from ₹118.06, citing updated assumptions that include a lower fair value estimate, softer revenue growth and profit margin expectations, and a higher future P/E multiple. What's in the News Re Sustainability signed an exclusive MoU with Indian Oil Corporation Limited to launch a national initiative for collecting and recycling used lubricating oil.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/energy/nse-ioc/indian-oil-shares/jh5qr9sw-traditional-refining-will-struggle-as-renewables-gain-traction-7qsr/updates/6-analysts-have-trimmed-their-price-target-on-indian-oil-to-indian-rupee1",
      "raw_subtype": "narrative-update"
    },
    {
      "id": "8c81426f-a505-4ab8-8d69-41dc2d7d226c",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-04-08T11:39:22.000Z",
      "title": "Now 27% overvalued",
      "body": "Over the last 90 days, the stock has fallen 8.3% to ₹143. The fair value is estimated to be ₹113, however this is not to be taken as a sell recommendation but rather should be used as a guide only. Revenue has declined by 2.9% over the last 3 years. Earnings per share has grown by 4.5%. Revenue is forecast to grow by 7.8% in 2 years. Earnings are forecast to decline by 33% in the next 2 years.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
